  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">“SciFest”-Science Fiesta for School Children’s from 7th to 12th Standard</h2>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\nGovernment of India\n\nMinistry of Science and Technology\n<h2>Department of Science and Technology\n\n<b>Project Title: “SciFest”-Science Fiesta for School Children from 7</b><b>th</b><b> to 12</b><b>th</b><b> Standard</b></h2>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Project Cost:</b>  Rs.17,90,800/-</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Target Area/Place of activity: </b>The events are planned to target the school children of  7th to 12th Standard from Chamarajanar, Mandya, Mysore, and Coorg Districts of Karnataka state, India.</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Duration of the Project:</b> 1 year</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Activity/Events Proposed:</b></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Hackathon</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Poster Presentation</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">JAM Competition</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Technical Project Exhibition</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Science Quiz Competition</li>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\">Essay Writing Competition</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n<ul>\n \t<li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Beneficiaries:</b> 800+ Participants</li>\n</ul>\n&nbsp;\n\n<b>Principal Investigator:</b>\n\nDr. Yathisha L\n\nAssociate Professor\n\nDepartment of Electronics and Communication Engineering\n\nATME College of Engineering\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<b>Co-Investigator:</b>\n\nMr. Guruprasad K N\n\nAssociate Professor\n\nDepartment of Electronics and Communication Engineering\n\nATME College of Engineering\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
